.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 19","synopsis":"Shigeru's daughter (Yuri) is found dead in the mountains. A painful skin infection breaks out in his village. Ginko can cure the disease of the villagers but Shigeru has a much more serious case. It turns out that he and the son of his deceased brother brought back the mushi causing the problem to the village when they broke a taboo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yx5xit3QFZFmSjVCCFme36mRudi.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 20","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10571","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20595","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20751","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21939","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24701","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"26867","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79214","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[20]}],"link":"22579","synopsis":"A restless man, Kanta, on his way home to his wife and young daughter (Futaba), sits down to rest in a forest. He is tired and thirsty so he eats a red fruit that was lying on the ground near him, and gives thanks to the plum. Some time after this, he starts having vivid memories both in his dreams and while awake of times going back before his birth. He goes looking for a huge tree but finding it does not make him happy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jZtgrdxBQRyxAX4sNXckU3n31Ob.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 20","synopsis":"A restless man, Kanta, on his way home to his wife and young daughter (Futaba), sits down to rest in a forest. He is tired and thirsty so he eats a red fruit that was lying on the ground near him, and gives thanks to the plum. Some time after this, he starts having vivid memories both in his d